      "path": "AGENTS.md",
      "text": "- **Release cadence (default posture, since 2026-08-04; suspended while release activation is blocked).** Outside an explicit pre-cut block, this project **ships real releases, often** \u2014 cut one whenever something production-ready lands, don't batch changes into a big release. Two channels, both driven from the approved `OSS-RELEASE.md` contract and **both triggered by pushing a `vX.Y.Z` tag**: **crates.io** via `publish-crates.yml` in CI (`taskfleet-core` first, then `taskfleet` \u2014 the CLI depends on `taskfleet-core = \"=<version>\"`; do NOT run `cargo publish` locally, see the dedicated bullet below), and **prebuilt binaries + the canonical Homebrew tap `jarimustonen/homebrew-taskfleet`** via cargo-dist (CI builds the mac target on a self-hosted runner). End state after R11: `brew install jarimustonen/taskfleet/taskfleet`; the old `jarimustonen/orchestratectl/orchestratectl` command remains the current public 0.5.1 location during the pre-cut block. The `/shipshape-release` skill selects the SemVer bump; the pinned Shipshape 0.10.1 resumable protocol and `scripts/shipshape-release.sh` execute it. Mechanics live in `OSS-RELEASE.md` + `dist-workspace.toml`."
